cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this architecture note or its diagrams, please cite it as below."
title: "AnalogLoop: A Two-Speed, Budget-Aware Agent Architecture for Analog Circuit Sizing"
abstract: >-
  A design note for LLM-driven analog circuit sizing that separates a stateless
  policy layer from a deterministic toolchain, adds a fast surrogate verification
  path with an explicit promotion gate, and keeps an append-only case ledger for
  replay and negative knowledge.
